{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cdj95maGqx6ETwq8g8ar1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"dispositions\":[{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A relevant Supply appears as a small inline synergy on a valid Approach.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A relevant Supply appears as a small inline synergy on a valid Approach.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"The interface states the contextual effect and that the item will be consumed.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The interface states the contextual effect and indicates the item will be consumed.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A2\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"conditional_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Supply is committed only when it can credibly affect the chosen Approach or its consequences.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Supply is committed only when it can credibly affect the chosen Approach or its consequences.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A3\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"The Supply is consumed when committed, whether or not the Approach achieves its intended outcome.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The Supply is consumed upon commitment regardless of whether the Approach succeeds.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A4\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Its stated effect still modifies the final resolution.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"The Supply's stated effect still modifies the final resolution even if the Approach fails.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A5\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"comparative_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"A Supply is normally stronger than a reusable Tool: it may decisively soften a consequence, preserve an additional stake, extend an achieved result, or enable a credible alternate resolution.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Supply is normally stronger than a reusable Tool, potentially softening a consequence, preserving an additional stake, extending an achieved result, or enabling a credible alternate resolution.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A6\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"negative_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"It never replaces the Turn or guarantees success.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A Supply never replaces the Turn or guarantees success.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A7\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Supply availability follows its carrier.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Supply availability is determined by its carrier.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A8\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"claim_kind\":\"conditional_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Separation, incapacity, tharn, or inability to bring the item makes it unavailable.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Separation, incapacity, tharn, or inability to bring the item makes a Supply unavailable.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-121-A9\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00121_9d73bc1a0834\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00123_fdcd3d500d41\",\"kind\":\"no_substantive_claim\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00126_d02a6537a14c\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Each Encounter MEET Turn permits one active personal-item intervention: select one Tool or spend one Supply.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Each Encounter MEET Turn permits one active personal-item intervention, either selecting one Tool or spending one Supply.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-126-A1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00126_d02a6537a14c\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule_with_rationale\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Keepsakes do not count as active interventions because they are present rather than used.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Keepsakes do not count as active interventions because they are present rather than used.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-126-A2\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"}],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00126_d02a6537a14c\",\"kind\":\"atoms\"},{\"atoms\":[],\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00128_832e2c9b1a59\",\"kind\":\"no_substantive_claim\"},{\"atoms\":[{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Each Citizen has one Supply box.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Each Citizen has one Supply box.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A1\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"definition\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Party capacity is simply the number of participating Citizens\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Party capacity equals the number of participating Citizens.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A2\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"negative_rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"there is no transferable abstract Supply capacity.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"There is no transferable abstract Supply capacity.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A3\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"Outside an Encounter, TRAVEL -\\\\> Party View -\\\\> Citizen View allows the player to discard a carried Supply at will.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"Outside an Encounter, the TRAVEL -> Party View -> Citizen View interface path allows the player to discard a carried Supply at will.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A4\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"consequence\",\"exact_source_text\":\"It leaves play and does not return to the Colony pool.\",\"normalized_claim\":\"A discarded Supply leaves play and does not return to the Colony pool.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A5\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\"block_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001__B00131_eb42ff53208b\",\"claim_kind\":\"rule\",\"exact_source_text\":\"An unspent Supply returns to the Colony prepared-Supply pool at Homecoming\",\"normalized_claim\":\"An unspent Supply returns to the Colony prepared-Supply pool at Homecoming.\",\"proposal_id\":\"M050-PI-131-A6\",\"source_id\":\"M050-SRC-PERSONAL-ITEMS-001\",\"stream\":\"evidence_game_semantic\"},{\